          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000620-d6411f5e",
        "ordinal": 620,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "As of December 31, 2025, the amount of total undiscounted future lease payments under operating leases was $18.3 billion, of which $3.3 billion is short-term, and total undiscounted future lease payments under finance leases was $2.9 billion, of which $491 million is short-term.",
        "text_hash": "d6411f5e439b1f341be33d608811cecb0e80d19864f0f77a0965a8d31c0473b9",
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_2116",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[669]",
        "reported_page": 38,
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000621-25f1a242",
        "ordinal": 621,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "As of December 31, 2025, we have entered into leases primarily related to data centers that have not yet commenced with short-term and long-term future lease payments of $5.8 billion and $52.7 billion, respectively. These leases will commence between 2026 and 2031 with non-cancelable lease terms primarily between one and 25 years.",
        "text_hash": "25f1a242f8023490add7887d2b8f974a28c874d2f5048f6820d625ceeffacc8c",
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_2116",
